# Keep committed assets LF regardless of the checkout platform. The SVGs are
# served straight from raw.githubusercontent.com, so byte-level churn from
# CRLF conversion would show up as spurious diffs on every Windows checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
